  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then the set of all values of <math><mi>x</mi></math>, at which the function <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>)</mo></math> is not differentiable, is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
